'''Awakened Bahamut Cat''' (覚醒のネコムート, ''Kakusei no Nekomūto'', '''Awakened Cathamut''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Bahamut Cat's Trial]]. He is the second enemy version of [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], the first being [[Raging Bahamut Cat]]. He was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Awakened Bahamut Cat
|image = E 717.png
|appearance = [[Bahamut Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 4,444¢ - 17,553¢
}}

==Enemy==
Awakened Bahamut Cat is an extreme threat, with already-high base damage that is effectively doubled by his 100% [[Explosion]], not to mention his very fast movement and attack speeds. His Explosion hits up to 575 range, meaning few units are able to fully outrange him. However, Awakened Bahamut Cat has one glaring flaw that makes him possible to beat, as unlike [[Raging Bahamut Cat]], his backswing is long enough to leave an opening for rushers like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] to sneak in a hit.

